  "project_description": "Default Content Access extends the Default Content and Content Access modules so that when nodes are exported or imported by Default Content, their per-node Content Access grant settings are exported/imported as well. It adds no menu, config UI or settings; all functionality is delivered through two Drush commands that subclass Default Content's own export/import commands, reading and writing the module's access/node.json files and the content_access database table.",
